{
 "uid": "clawctl-fleet",
 "title": "clawctl 機隊",
 "tags": [
  "clawctl"
 ],
 "timezone": "browser",
 "schemaVersion": 39,
 "version": 1,
 "refresh": "1m",
 "time": {
  "from": "now-6h",
  "to": "now"
 },
 "panels": [
  {
   "type": "text",
   "title": "這一頁在回答什麼",
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 5,
    "w": 24,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0
   },
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "**作業系統的事實**（node_exporter）跟 **AI agent 的事實**（clawctl）第一次在同一條時間軸上。\n\n⚠ 最底下那張圖是這整件事的理由：以前這兩組數字在兩個平行宇宙，「sampleagent2 開始 `baseline_hash_mismatch` 的那一刻，記憶體/負載發生了什麼」問不出來。\n\n⚠⚠ **空的面板第一個要懷疑的是有沒有問對地方**，不是「機隊很安靜」。`up == 0` 不代表機器死了 —— sampleagent1 就是活的（tailscale direct handshake、TCP/22 通、每 30 分鐘一次 heartbeat），它只是刻意沒裝 agent。"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "stat",
   "title": "名冊（分母）",
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 5,
    "w": 6,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 5
   },
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "clawctl-prom"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "expr": "clawctl_machines_total",
     "legendFormat": "名冊上",
     "refId": "A"
    },
    {
     "expr": "count(up{job=\"node\"} == 1)",
     "legendFormat": "抓得到",
     "refId": "B"
    },
    {
     "expr": "count(clawctl_machine_last_checkin_age_seconds)",
     "legendFormat": "agent 有回報",
     "refId": "C"
    }
   ],
   "options": {
    "reduceOptions": {
     "calcs": [
      "lastNotNull"
     ]
    },
    "textMode": "value_and_name"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "table",
   "title": "每一台現在的狀態",
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 5,
    "w": 18,
    "x": 6,
    "y": 5
   },
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "clawctl-prom"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "expr": "clawctl_machine_state",
     "format": "table",
     "instant": true,
     "refId": "A"
    }
   ],
   "transformations": [
    {
     "id": "organize",
     "options": {
      "excludeByName": {
       "Time": true,
       "Value": true,
       "__name__": true,
       "instance": true,
       "job": true,
       "machine_id": true
      }
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "bargauge",
   "title": "憑證還剩多久（負值＝已經過期）",
   "description": "這一格是 osquery / node_exporter 看不到的東西：機器連得上、agent 在回報，它只是做不了事。",
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 8,
    "w": 12,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 10
   },
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "clawctl-prom"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "expr": "clawctl_credential_expiry_seconds",
     "legendFormat": "{{machine}} / {{provider}}",
     "instant": true,
     "refId": "A"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "s",
     "thresholds": {
      "mode": "absolute",
      "steps": [
       {
        "color": "red",
        "value": null
       },
       {
        "color": "orange",
        "value": 0
       },
       {
        "color": "green",
        "value": 21600
       }
      ]
     }
    }
   },
   "options": {
    "displayMode": "gradient",
    "orientation": "horizontal"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "timeseries",
   "title": "宣告的事件（not_ok）在窗口內出現幾次",
   "description": "⚠ 0 也會畫出來。一條消失的線跟一條壓在 0 的線意思完全不同 —— 前者代表這條規則沒在看。",
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 8,
    "w": 12,
    "x": 12,
    "y": 10
   },
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "clawctl-prom"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "expr": "clawctl_event_count",
     "legendFormat": "{{machine}} / {{event}}",
     "refId": "A"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "custom": {
      "drawStyle": "line",
      "lineWidth": 2,
      "fillOpacity": 8
     }
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "timeseries",
   "title": "產出物年齡 vs 人宣告的門檻",
   "description": "門檻是 expectations.json 裡宣告的 max_age_seconds，跟事實一起被吐出來 —— 所以這張圖不用為每台機器各畫一條。",
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 8,
    "w": 12,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 18
   },
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "clawctl-prom"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "expr": "clawctl_artifact_age_seconds",
     "legendFormat": "{{machine}} 年齡",
     "refId": "A"
    },
    {
     "expr": "clawctl_artifact_max_age_seconds",
     "legendFormat": "{{machine}} 門檻",
     "refId": "B"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "s",
     "custom": {
      "drawStyle": "line",
      "lineWidth": 2
     }
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "timeseries",
   "title": "agent 心跳年齡",
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 8,
    "w": 12,
    "x": 12,
    "y": 18
   },
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "clawctl-prom"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "expr": "clawctl_machine_last_checkin_age_seconds",
     "legendFormat": "{{machine}}",
     "refId": "A"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "s"
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "timeseries",
   "title": "⭐ 兩個世界疊在一起：sampleagent2 的事件流 vs 它的作業系統",
   "description": "這張圖是整個 Prometheus 遷移的理由。左邊是 clawctl 量的 AI agent 事實，右邊是 node_exporter 量的作業系統事實。以前這兩組數字在兩個平行宇宙，問不出「它為什麼開始失敗」。",
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 10,
    "w": 24,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 26
   },
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "clawctl-prom"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "expr": "clawctl_event_count{machine=\"sampleagent2\", event=\"baseline_hash_mismatch\"}",
     "legendFormat": "baseline_hash_mismatch（clawctl）",
     "refId": "A"
    },
    {
     "expr": "node_load1{machine=\"sampleagent2\"}",
     "legendFormat": "load1（node_exporter）",
     "refId": "B"
    },
    {
     "expr": "100 - (node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes{machine=\"sampleagent2\"} / node_memory_MemTotal_bytes{machine=\"sampleagent2\"} * 100)",
     "legendFormat": "記憶體用量 %（node_exporter）",
     "refId": "C"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "custom": {
      "drawStyle": "line",
      "lineWidth": 2,
      "fillOpacity": 5
     }
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "table",
   "title": "Agent 版本",
   "description": "各機器最近回報的 Agent 版本。列數需與名冊一致；部署驗證：count by (version, machine) (clawctl_agent_info)",
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 6,
    "w": 12,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 36
   },
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "clawctl-prom"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "expr": "clawctl_agent_info",
     "legendFormat": "{{machine}}",
     "refId": "A",
     "format": "table",
     "instant": true
    }
   ],
   "transformations": [
    {
     "id": "organize",
     "options": {
      "excludeByName": {
       "Time": true,
       "__name__": true,
       "instance": true,
       "job": true,
       "machine_id": true,
       "Value": true
      },
      "renameByName": {
       "machine": "機器",
       "version": "版本"
      }
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "stat",
   "title": "機隊在幾個版本上",
   "description": "1 = 全機隊同一版。>1 = 有機器沒推到，或推到一半。\n\n⚠ 這個數字**看不到「不在表上」的機器** —— 一台從沒報到過的機器不會有版本，於是它不會讓這個數字變大。它會安靜地不存在。所以這一格永遠要跟左邊那張表的列數、跟名冊分母一起看。\n「一個空的、乾淨的、沒有壞消息的答案，第一個要懷疑的是你有沒有問對地方。」",
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 6,
    "w": 12,
    "x": 12,
    "y": 36
   },
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "clawctl-prom"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "expr": "count(count by (version) (clawctl_agent_info))",
     "legendFormat": "不同版本數",
     "refId": "A"
    },
    {
     "expr": "count(clawctl_agent_info)",
     "legendFormat": "有回報版本的機器",
     "refId": "B"
    },
    {
     "expr": "clawctl_machines_total",
     "legendFormat": "名冊上（差額＝沒有版本的）",
     "refId": "C"
    }
   ],
   "options": {
    "reduceOptions": {
     "calcs": [
      "lastNotNull"
     ]
    },
    "textMode": "value_and_name"
   }
  }
 ]
}
